   611	By comparing Propositions \ref{MSKprop} and \ref{NSKprop} it is now clear that the two information rates have the same behaviour.  This explains that the matching procedure we perform at the end of the previous section will attain the information rate of NSK also in the asymptotic limit. Moreover it justifies the claim on the large-$N$ behaviour of irreducible polynomials with respect to prime numbers. }
